{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15849","headline":"送冯八将军奏事毕归滑台幕府 · 崔峒","name":"送冯八将军奏事毕归滑台幕府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王门别後到沧洲，帝里相逢俱白头。\n自欢马卿常带疾，还嗟李广不封侯。\n棠梨宫里瞻龙衮，细柳营中着虎裘。\n想到滑台桑叶落，黄河东注杏园秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔峒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15849.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15849","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}